      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this remains retry logic remain here, I don\u0027t like mixing the retry logic with the polling of the command complete. \n\nThis is easier to follow as two separate loops.\n\n```\ndo {\n    rv \u003d rts54_post_command();\n\n    if (rv !\u003d -EBUSY)\n        return rv;\n        \n    if (++call_counter \u003e 100)\n        return -EBUSY;\n} while (rv !\u003d 0);\n\n/* setup callback */\n\n/* Perform polling on post command result as normal */\n```",
